  "attributes": [],
  "category": {
    "name": "picnic",
    "url": "/api/v2/item-category/55/"
  },
  "effect_entries": [],
  "flavor_text_entries": [
    {
      "text": "厚手の生地で　丈夫な　テーブルクロス。元気な黄色の　チェック柄で食卓を　明るく　変身させる。",
      "version_group": {
        "name": "scarlet-violet",
        "url": "/api/v2/version-group/25/"
      },
      "language": {
        "name": "ja-hrkt",
        "url": "/api/v2/language/1/"
      }
    },
    {
      "text": "두꺼운 천으로 만든 튼튼한 테이블보. 활기 넘치는 노란색 체크무늬로 식탁을 밝게 만들어 준다.",
      "version_group": {
        "name": "scarlet-violet",
        "url": "/api/v2/version-group/25/"
      },
      "language": {
        "name": "ko",
        "url": "/api/v2/language/3/"
      }
    },
    {
      "text": "質地厚實，牢固耐用的桌巾。象徵活力的黃色格紋為餐桌帶來歡愉的氣息。",
      "version_group": {
        "name": "scarlet-violet",
        "url": "/api/v2/version-group/25/"
      },
      "language": {
        "name": "zh-hant",
        "url": "/api/v2/language/4/"
      }
    },
    {
      "text": "Une nappe résistante coupée dans un tissu épais. Le motif jaune à carreaux apporte de la lumière à n’importe quelle table.",
      "version_group": {
        "name": "scarlet-violet",
        "url": "/api/v2/version-group/25/"
      },
      "language": {
        "name": "fr",
        "url": "/api/v2/language/5/"
      }
    },
    {
      "text": "Ein robustes Tischtuch aus dickem Stoff. Mit seinem kräftigen gelben Karomuster zaubert es eine ordentliche Portion Lebensfreude auf den Esstisch.",
      "version_group": {
        "name": "scarlet-violet",
        "url": "/api/v2/version-group/25/"
      },
      "language": {
        "name": "de",
        "url": "/api/v2/language/6/"
      }
    },
    {
      "text": "Hecho de un material grueso y resistente, este mantel a cuadros de un brillante color ámbar da vida a cualquier mesa.",
      "version_group": {
        "name": "scarlet-violet",
        "url": "/api/v2/version-group/25/"
      },
      "language": {
        "name": "es",
        "url": "/api/v2/language/7/"
      }
    },
    {
      "text": "Tovaglia robusta realizzata in tessuto spesso. Il suo motivo a scacchi di un bel giallo vivace trasforma la tavola donandole allegria.",
      "version_group": {
        "name": "scarlet-violet",
        "url": "/api/v2/version-group/25/"
      },
      "language": {
        "name": "it",
        "url": "/api/v2/language/8/"
      }
    },
    {
      "text": "A sturdy tablecloth made of thick fabric. The cheery yellow plaid brightens up a table.",
      "version_group": {
        "name": "scarlet-violet",
        "url": "/api/v2/version-group/25/"
      },
      "language": {
        "name": "en",
        "url": "/api/v2/language/9/"
      }
    },
    {
      "text": "厚手の生地で　丈夫な　テーブルクロス。元気な黄色の　チェック柄で食卓を　明るく　変身させる。",
      "version_group": {
        "name": "scarlet-violet",
        "url": "/api/v2/version-group/25/"
      },
      "language": {
        "name": "ja",
        "url": "/api/v2/language/11/"
      }
    },
    {
      "text": "以厚重布料制作的结实桌巾。其充满活力的黄色格子图案，能让食桌摇身变得充满生机。",
      "version_group": {
        "name": "scarlet-violet",
        "url": "/api/v2/version-group/25/"
      },
      "language": {
